1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Leo is at the airport.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
He's going on his first trip to London.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
But something is wrong. He doesn't know where to go!

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Oh no! Where is the check-in counter?

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Don't worry, Leo! I'll help you.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Leo and Emma walk into the airport.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Emma, I'm a little nervous.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
It's okay! Traveling is exciting.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
What's the first thing we need to do?

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
We need to check in and get your boarding pass.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Good morning! Where are you flying today?

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I'm flying to London.

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
May I see your passport, please?

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Of course. Here you are.

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Do you have any bags to check in?

16
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Yes, I have one suitcase.

17
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Here is your boarding pass.

18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Thank you very much!

19
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Emma, where is Gate 12?

20
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Let's look at the information screen.

21
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
It says Gate 12 is on the left.

22
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:12,000
That's right! Let's go.

23
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Thank you for helping me!

24
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Please put your bag on the tray.

25
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Okay. Is this everything?

26
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Please walk through the scanner.

27
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Leo passes the security check. Everything is fine!

28
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Passengers for London, boarding is now open.

29
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Emma! It's time to board!

30
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Have a wonderful trip!

31
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Thank you! See you soon!

32
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Leo smiles and walks toward the airplane.

33
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:35,000
He is ready for his first adventure!
